## WHY THIS EXISTS

Incorrect phone numbers were generated in multiple submissions because old information was hardcoded in templates. This caused the wrong phone number (248.247.5020) to appear on documents sent to government contracting officers, which is unprofessional and could result in missed callbacks.

**This is a business-critical rule. Wrong contact info = lost contracts.**
